Package: segreg
Title: Segmented Regression with Automatic Breakpoint Selection
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("JK", "Kim", , "kimjk@agronomy4future.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-9913-8768"))
Description: Fits segmented (piecewise linear) regression models with zero
    to a user-specified maximum number of breakpoints using the 'segmented'
    package, and selects the number of breakpoints by AIC or BIC. Each
    observation is assigned to a phase defined by the estimated breakpoints,
    and slopes are reported for each phase. Layers for 'ggplot2' are provided
    to add the fitted segmented line and vertical lines at breakpoints or
    phase boundaries to existing plots.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Depends: 
    R (>= 3.6)
Imports: 
    ggplot2,
    segmented,
    stats,
    utils
Encoding: UTF-8
